{#
  Icon by nowo_ui_kit_icon_set.

  Required:
    - name: canonical action kind or free string (ux_icon / fallback class)

  Canonical kinds (REQ-UI-001):
    edit, delete, view, copy, create, save, cancel, restore, share, config,
    export, filter, prev, next, close
  1.17 (chrome toggles): filter_off, scroll_horizontal, rows, chevron_up, chevron_down,
    chevron_right, book
  2.13: tour (guided tour tab)
  2.20: sort, sort_asc, sort_desc (sortable table headers: neutral / ascending / descending arrows)
  2.21: more (vertical dots: the square "more" menu of a split page header)
  2.27: home (the compact header's home link), grid (the page-actions trigger), chevron_left
  Unreleased (one icon per action): extend, revoke, refresh, archive, pause, resume, download, import, send, sign_in,
    sign_out, reset, mark_done, mark_all_done, move, enable, disable, hide, run, retry, stop

  Host override: nowo_ui_kit.action_icons (kind => `[prefix:]name`) applies to every use of a canonical kind here.
    ux_icon: the name goes to ux_icon() as written. tabler-icons: `tabler:x` or bare `x`. bootstrap-icons: `bi:x` or
    bare `x`. A name the set cannot draw (another prefix), and svg_inline / none always: the kit default of the kind.

  free_name (only partials/_menu hash and Link items): keeps `bi bi-refresh` under bootstrap-icons for a menu item that
    passed `refresh` as a free name before it was a kind (byte-identical output, tests/Fixtures/bc-2.27).

  Optional:
    - label: accessible text (aria-hidden decorative when parent has aria-label)
#}
{% set icon_set = nowo_ui_kit_icon_set|default('bootstrap-icons') %}
{% set label = label|default(name) %}
{% set _override = nowo_ui_kit_action_icons[name]|default(null) %}
{% set _override_prefix = _override and ':' in _override ? _override|split(':')|first : null %}
{% set _override_name = _override ? _override|split(':')|last : null %}
{% if icon_set == 'none' %}
    <span class="nowo-ui-icon nowo-ui-icon--text">{{ label }}</span>
{% elseif icon_set == 'ux_icon' %}
